	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "2b05fda7-ae09-49b0-8b79-3db71441e6db",
		"name": "G money - Share with Partners - Request To Pay",
		"description": "# AUTH REQUIREMENTS\n\n1. UAT/PROD Base URL\n    \n2. Merchant Code\n    \n3. Client ID and Client Secrete\n    \n4. Your Prod IP to whitelist\n    \n\n# API LIST\n\n## 🔐 1. Generate Token\n\nFirst you need to generate your Bearer token using your client ID and password\n\n## 💸 2. Initiate Request To Pay\n\nUse your generated token trigger an RTP request to the G-money customer and wait for the user to approve\n\n## 🔎 3. RTP Status Query\n\nUse your generated token to call this API to check the status of the Request to Pay. Possible values include:\n\nPENDING - user is yet to approve  \nEXPIRED - request has expired  \nDECLINED - user declined the RTP request  \nCANCELLED - request is cancelled\n\nPROCESSED - Process completed",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "16194081",
		"_collection_link": "https://solar-equinox-778250.postman.co/workspace/Cross-Switch~3eeeed1d-d03e-436d-aebc-7ee2037a53cd/collection/16194081-2b05fda7-ae09-49b0-8b79-3db71441e6db?action=share&source=collection_link&creator=16194081"
	},
